ed Checks | We assess a $25.00 charge on returned checks for insufficient funds. If service is disconnected, you are required to pay an additional $25.00 before the service will be restored. Sorry, we won’t accept payment by check on the account for a year. | Processing Payments | Your payment is processed on the day we receive it , not the day "], "via": "Utility Service"}, {"url": "https://cityofatchison.com/action-center/utility-service-request/", "lines": [], "via": "Utility Service Request"}, {"url": "https://cityofatchison.com/residents/services-programs/", "lines": [], "via": "Services & Programs"}, {"url": "https://cityofatchison.com/faq-items/do-you-offer-special-services-for-elderly-and-or-disabled-customers/", "lines": [], "via": "Do you offer specialty trash/recycling services for elderly "}]}
