{"id": 2172, "name": "Four Oaks RV Park (Pittsburg)", "read": "2026-10-15", "pages": [{"url": "https://www.pittks.org/visit/parks-recreation/facilities-rv-park", "lines": ["310 Registration and full payment is required in advance for reservations. We accept cash, personal checks and debit/credit cards. The full reservation amount will be charged at time of reservation. | RV Space Rental is $20 Per Day Per Space | 12 Spaces Available. | Check Out: 11AM | Reserve An RV Space Refunds/Cancellations Cancellations may be made up to 7 business days before the reservation date. There will be no"]}, {"url": "https://www.pittks.org/residents/services-providers/", "lines": [], "via": "Service Providers for Residents"}, {"url": "https://www.pittks.org/residents/water-service-application/", "lines": ["rs. | | A connection fee is required if the water service is currently disconnected. If this is necessary there will be a fee added to your first months bill. The current fees are Inside City Limits is a one time fee of $10 | Outside City limits is a one time fee of $20 | Where is the property located? (Required) Inside the City Limits Outside the City Limits Telephone Number where we can reach you? Preferred method "], "via": "Start/Stop Water Service"}, {"url": "https://www.pittks.org/residents/services-permits-special-event/", "lines": [], "via": "Special Event Permits"}, {"url": "https://www.pittks.org/residents/housing/support-services/", "lines": ["ity Deposit Assistance Program Program Overview | TBRA Security Deposit Assistance Program helps cover upfront costs, making it easier to secure safe and affordable housing. This program provides financial support—up to $800—for eligible households, reducing barriers to move-in and helping individuals and families transition into stable homes. | How to Apply | To apply for TBRA Security Deposit Assistance, you must v", " proof of income, and documentation related to your approved housing unit. Providing complete and accurate documents will help avoid delays in processing your assistance. | Funding Limits | Assistance is available up to $800 for eligible households to help cover security deposits. The exact amount awarded will depend on the deposit required for your approved unit and program guidelines. | Participating Landlords | La"], "via": "Housing Support Services"}]}
{"id": 2173, "name": "Frazier Park (Ulysses)", "read": "2026-10-15", "pages": [{"url": "https://cityofulysses.com/parks/camping-frazier-park/", "lines": [" with water & electricity, 1 with electricity only. They all include concrete pads, barbeque, and picnic table. Access to the playground and restroom facilities, shower located in east restroom by lake. Fees: | A fee of $15 per recreational vehicle (R.V.) per night will be charged for the use of the utility hookups at Frazier Park. The time period for which the $15 covers shall expire at 12:00 pm the following day. A", "troom facilities, shower located in east restroom by lake. Fees: | A fee of $15 per recreational vehicle (R.V.) per night will be charged for the use of the utility hookups at Frazier Park. The time period for which the $15 covers shall expire at 12:00 pm the following day. Any recreational vehicle that remains after this time is subject to another night’s fee. Please pay at the Ulysses Golf Pro Shop . | Rules: | Dum"]}, {"url": "https://cityofulysses.com/contact-us/service-request/", "lines": [], "via": "Service Request"}, {"url": "https://cityofulysses.com/contact-us/service-request/", "lines": [], "via": "Service Request"}, {"url": "https://cityofulysses.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/2023_golf_course_fees.pdf", "pdf": true, "via": "2023 Golf Course Fees"}, {"url": "https://cityofulysses.com/parks/park-reservations/", "lines": [], "via": "Park Reservations"}]}
